OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F170A1789232059
OL,1,W5j 5Q7+j 55"k#j 5w;js1
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%-,* *,%%**,$ ,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AMuseum agrees to return remains to
OL,4,Aancestral homeland
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn 2020, the museum removed all human
OL,7,Fremains from public display as part of
OL,8,Fwhat the it called a "decolonisation
OL,9,Fprocess" - including the ancestral Naga
OL,10,Fremains.
OL,12,FThe museum has now announced that a
OL,13,Fformal decision has been made by the
OL,14,FUniversity of Oxford Council to return
OL,15,Fthe 39 ancestral human remains to their
OL,16,Fhomeland.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
